    "created_at": "2024-09-30T17:20:43Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-09-30T17:20:43Z",
    "body": "We discussed this issue during TPAC 2024. Minutes can be found here: https://github.com/whatwg/meta/issues/326#issuecomment-2377500295\r\n\r\nThe group support for `getSelectionBoundingClientRect()`. We should also consider expansions to include custom start/end offset. Another suggestion is to add another API to expose a set of rects similar to [`Range.getClientRects()`](https://drafts.csswg.org/cssom-view/#dom-range-getclientrects). \r\n\r\nBased on the discussion. I think we can resolve the issue with the following proposed resolution:\r\n\r\nAdd `getSelectionBoundingCLientRect()` API to textarea/input element. Open another issue to keep track of adding additional API to expose set of client rects for selection range in textarea/input element.\r\n\r\n\r\ncc @keithamus @sanketj ",
