    "updated_at": "2025-07-21T23:39:35Z",
    "body": "Based on feedback, we are now exploring a new approach, as the previous one didn't resolve the issue with the [Custom Highlights API](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/CSS_Custom_Highlight_API). Our new proposal is currently being tracked under [FormControlRange Interface](https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/11478), and you can find the corresponding explainer [here](https://github.com/MicrosoftEdge/MSEdgeExplainers/blob/main/FormControlRange/explainer.md).",
